{"3894600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saga of Yurina", "steam_appid": 3894600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System: The Ultimate Clash of Blades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.poster.avif?t=1788178384\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.webm?t=1788178384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.mp4?t=1788178384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an advanced parrying system that brings the chilling tension of a Katana duel to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard:</strong> Raise your sword to block deadly enemy attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/b0b1fdad510dafa6805831bcc8db5dcd.avif?t=1788178384\" width=402 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry:</strong> Deflect attacks with perfect timing to turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/637bcaa4a2e76af30592a86b6e7221da.avif?t=1788178384\" width=432 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Focus is depleted when guarding or taking damage. If your Focus runs out entirely, your stance will break, leaving you defenseless. However, executing a perfect parry will drain your enemy's Focus instead, creating an opening for a fatal blow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f387e413b750fb0b74babcd1172a5549.avif?t=1788178384\" width=466 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection Elements: Secrets of a Hidden World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/183e443a8112f9c6e038aa308b4f51a7.avif?t=1788178384\" width=538 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the intricately interwoven Metroidvania map to uncover various hidden collectibles and forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Story: For the Revival of the Clan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/e23fe26b2f69593109a6d841af97d609.avif?t=1788178384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras_big/e23fe26b2f69593109a6d841af97d609.webp?t=1788178384 width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rebuild the fallen Amane clan, Yurina Amane becomes a 'Mikoto', the clan's representative duelist, striking down the formidable foes that stand in her way one by one.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System: The Ultimate Clash of Blades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.poster.avif?t=1788178384\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.webm?t=1788178384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/f281284f92602e68da70b980102fa678.mp4?t=1788178384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an advanced parrying system that brings the chilling tension of a Katana duel to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard:</strong> Raise your sword to block deadly enemy attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/b0b1fdad510dafa6805831bcc8db5dcd.avif?t=1788178384\" width=402 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry:</strong> Deflect attacks with perfect timing to turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/extras/637bcaa4a2e76af30592a86b6e7221da.avif?t=1788178384\" width=432 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Focus is depleted when guarding or taking damage. If your Focus runs out entirely, your stance will break, leaving you defenseless. However, executing a perfect parry will drain your enemy's Focus instead, creating an opening for a fatal blow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea